ng a trailer before the  movie comes out now of course this isn't  breaking news but some people were  actually starting to believe that  perhaps they weren't actually going to  release a trailer the marketing strategy  for spider-man no way home has been a  little bit different than we've seen for  pretty much anything in the past but i  do believe that this is due to the fact  that it's going to be an insanely huge  film and right now they're not exactly  sure if they're going to keep that  release date as of right now it's the  same and hopefully it stays that way but  i did actually happen to hear some news  recently about footage at cinemacon on  monday according to a personal source of  mine sony does indeed have something  prepared for spiderman home for  cinemacon it was not classified whether  or not this is a trailer or footage he  simply said something is prepared now  will the public see that right away  probably not we're probably not going to  see that monday maybe tuesday but that  is not confirmed it's just a guess at  this point in time however like i've  been saying we're gonna get a  description of whatever is shown no it  probably won't be leaked and if it does  sony is definitely going to be copy  striking people and perhaps even taking  legal action but one thing you can't  really do that for is a description and  people are gonna come out of that  cinemacon footage trailer whatever  they're showing and they're gonna talk  and the second i hear anything about it  i'll be sure to do a video on it asap  and you can also notice that some of the  official sony youtube channels have made  a playlist now for spider-man no way  home and the current thing and the only  thing that's in the playlist is the  title reveal but the playlist is made  which means other videos for no way home  are coming this is another good sign  that the trailer or footage or whatever  is not too far away and they're going to  upload it on youtube so i think we're  getting pretty close and we're just a  few days away from getting a description  now we do have some avengers 5 news from  kevin feige himself in an interview that  he did with collider the mcu is a lot  bigger than it was back in 2012 and the  notion that you can now bring everybody  together will take a lot more than four  years so after stating this collider  steven weintraub asked marvel studios  president about when the next team-up  film avengers 5 could be in which kevin  feige said this i think we want there to  be a reasonable amount of time from the  end game to start a new saga which is  already underway and already started and  then you need time as you did in phase  one to build that saga before you start  bringing everyone together now clearly  things are different now before in the  first phase there were only five movies  released before avengers came out and  right now we technically only have one  movie that has been released that will  actually go into avengers 5 because  unfortunately black widow won't so right  now we just have chang chi of course the  disney plush shows will tie into the  avengers but not everybody is going to  be a part of the new avengers team so  although kevin feige does say that it's  underway and groundwork is being laid  it'll probably be another four to five  years until we get a new avengers team  at the most at least perhaps we could  get it a little bit before but we'll  probably need another four to five  movies about people who are actually  going to be a part of the new avengers  team because not everybody is but it is  actually good that marvel is taking  their time with this we don't want  things to get repetitive marvel just  can't repeat what they did for the  infinity saga they need to do something  new and when everybody sees shang chi  and i believe the eternals i think we'll  realize that marvel really is changing  up things in a very very good way so yes  the avengers team are kind of starting  to be assembled we're starting to get  introduced to them but they're not going  to come together for a few years at  least and we'll get deadpool 3 before we  get avengers 5 which to me is great news  because i really hope deadpool is a part  of the next avengers team i think it  would be hilarious and we have news on  deadpool 3 today coming from  brandondavis comicbook.com in an  interview with kevin feige brandon davis  asked him if they have a release date  window set for deadpool 3 to make his  mcu debut and kevin feige said this we  do and the script is in the works and  ryan is working very hard on it with our  writers as we speak so this is extremely  good news and i actually kind of heard  something at the premiere of xiang chi  nothing major but i did pretty much hear  that ryan reynolds right now is pretty  much just devoting all of his time to  writing the script he's pretty much just  taking his kids to school writing the  script picking them up writing the  script some more and this is great  because recently he stated that there's  about a 70 chance that they're going to  start filming in 2022 which means we'll  probably get the movie late 2022 or  early 2023 which means it's not that far  away which is awesome because i know  everybody is super excited for ryan  reynolds and deadpool to enter the  marvel cinematic universe now we have  some pretty big iron heart and black  panther 2 wakanda forever news coming  from the same interview with kevinfoggy  and comicbook.com kevin feige told  comicbook.com we're shooting black  panther wakanda forever right now and  the character of riri williams you will  meet in black panther 2 first marvel  studios has announced that dominique  thorne is going to be playing the  character of riri williams and kevin  feige said that she started shooting i  think this week before her iron heart  series so riri williams iron heart is  going to be in black panther 2 which  makes me think that perhaps her iron man  suit could be made of vibranium i think  that would be a really cool way to go  actually the biggest video i've ever  done is about a theory that iron man was  going to get a vibranium suit for  infinity war and in-game that obviously  didn't happen but i think the concept is  a really cool idea and i'm hoping that  maybe her iron heart suit will be made  of vibranium now last but not least in  an interview with collider kevin feige  did confirm that loki season 2 is  underway he stated it is underway we're  developing it as we speak the hope is  that much of the same team will return  kate is going on to bigger and better  things so the director search will begin  shortly this is great news because that  means we're not gonna have to wait years  and years for loki season two it  actually seems like it's going to be  coming relatively soon within the next  couple of years which makes a ton of  sense considering the fact that loki had  a huge huge perhaps the biggest impact  on the mcu that we've really ever seen  and we were kind of left on a  cliffhanger there so we're gonna have to  find out what happens there relatively  soon now as far as the trailer updates  aren't concerned it seems like the  rumors that we've been hearing for these  other trailers have been pretty accurate  so far yesterday we did receive the  final eternals trailer and like i said i  did hear from a source that they are  going to be showing spiderman no way  home footage at cinemacon on monday  which leads me to believe that the other  rumors i've been hearing are probably  somewhat true as well meaning that we  should be getting a hawkeye trailer this  month or next month perhaps at the emmys  a miss marvel trailer perhaps at the  same time and a doctor strange in the  multiverse of madness trailer before the  end of the year however i'm not so sure  about that doctor strange one but that's  it for all the news that happened  yesterday like i said it was a lot but  things are starting to get really really  exciting in